      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“她说自己虽然很喜欢跑步，但却没有才能。\n……之前帮我送行时，她还笑着说要像我一样\n在中央跑步，现在却要放弃了。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b041c5f276d8b15ad03587eda1fd82d0744e6bed816f8d5504a6470f8aca436d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
