      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我决定要让她看看我闪亮亮的表现！\n我要以‘盛冈之星’的身份，带给她梦想……！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f25732e6f519b08b04020efaa9419b1792aa61985277498cac0de49197c05a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
