    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e3c2660a8fb0f94d721ed01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“给妈妈跟爸爸。等一下就是‘秋华赏’了！\n我原本是想跑出厉害的表现，\n让粉丝们能再重新支持我的──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d56074cb59d30a147c00d9fb952ab2a5ed05199baeb08dd375ab80dfe12c03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
