      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“……结果我的粉丝却再也不来了。\n我吓了一跳，脑子里一片混乱。\n不过，训练员这么对我说了。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "7984ed2640f8683e2c47c0d1f36f5cf8b21eaf5120e021470e0c08314a2ea507",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
